{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"MCP（Model Context Protocol）协议是什么？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">什么是 MCP（Model Context Protocol）协议？请解释它的核心概念、架构组件和设计目标。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP（Model Context Protocol，模型上下文协议）是由 <strong>Anthropic</strong> 于 2024 年推出的开放协议，用于标准化 AI 应用与外部工具、数据源和提示模板之间的连接。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"核心定位\" dir=\"auto\">核心定位</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 类比为 <strong>AI 世界的 USB-C 接口</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">就像 USB-C 统一了各种设备的充电和数据连接</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">MCP 统一了 AI 应用与外部工具、数据库、API 的连接方式</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"核心架构（Host-Client-Server 三层模型）\" dir=\"auto\">核心架构（Host-Client-Server 三层模型）</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    MCP Host                         │\n│  (AI 应用：Claude Desktop、Cursor、IDE 等)           │\n│                                                     │\n│  ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐              │\n│  │  MCP Client 1 │    │  MCP Client 2 │              │\n│  │ (连接Server 1)│    │ (连接Server 2)│              │\n│  └──────┬───────┘    └──────┬───────┘              │\n└─────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────────┘\n          │                  │\n    ┌─────▼─────┐     ┌─────▼─────┐\n    │ MCP Server │     │ MCP Server │\n    │  (文件系统) │     │  (数据库)  │\n    └────────────┘     └────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"三个核心角色\" dir=\"auto\">三个核心角色</h4>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Host</strong></td>\n<td>AI 应用本身，负责用户交互、模型调用、权限和上下文聚合</td>\n<td>Claude Desktop、Cursor、ChatGPT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Client</strong></td>\n<td>Host 内部连接某个 Server 的组件，维护连接、处理请求/响应</td>\n<td>SDK 中的 Client 实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Server</strong></td>\n<td>暴露工具(Tools)、资源(Resources)、提示(Prompts)的服务端</td>\n<td>文件系统 Server、数据库 Server</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">一个 Host 可以有多个 Client，每个 Client 通常对应一个 Server。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"Server 暴露的三类能力\" dir=\"auto\">Server 暴露的三类能力</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力类型</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工具</strong></td>\n<td>Tools</td>\n<td>模型可以主动调用的动作（查数据库、发消息、调 API）</td>\n<td>\"做什么\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>资源</strong></td>\n<td>Resources</td>\n<td>只读的上下文数据（文件内容、数据库 schema、API 文档）</td>\n<td>\"看什么\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>提示</strong></td>\n<td>Prompts</td>\n<td>可复用的提示模板，指导模型按流程使用工具和资源</td>\n<td>\"怎么做\"</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"通信协议\" dir=\"auto\">通信协议</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 基于 <strong>JSON-RPC 2.0</strong> 进行通信，传输层支持多种方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传输方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>stdio</strong></td>\n<td>本地进程通信</td>\n<td>极低延迟、高安全性、仅限本地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>SSE (HTTP)</strong></td>\n<td>远程通信（逐步淘汰）</td>\n<td>支持多客户端、长连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Streamable HTTP</strong></td>\n<td>云原生/分布式（推荐）</td>\n<td>基于 HTTP/2/3、支持多路复用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"设计目标\" dir=\"auto\">设计目标</h3>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>标准化工具接入</strong>：一次定义，多处使用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>跨平台复用</strong>：同个 MCP Server 可被 Claude、Cursor、LangChain 等任何兼容平台使用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>解耦</strong>：将\"工具怎么被 AI 使用\"和\"工具怎么被实现\"彻底解耦</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>安全可控</strong>：内置权限控制、会话隔离、审计日志</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-heading=\"代码示例：MCP Server 最简实现\" dir=\"auto\">代码示例：MCP Server 最简实现</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># server.py - 一个简单的 MCP Server（文件系统工具）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>server<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fastmcp <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> FastMCP\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建 MCP Server 实例</span>\nmcp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> FastMCP<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"filesystem-server\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 定义一个 Tool</span>\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">read_file</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"读取指定路径的文件内容。仅支持读取文本文件。\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">open</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'r'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> encoding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'utf-8'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> f<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> f<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 定义一个 Resource</span>\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>resource</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"file://{path}\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_file_content</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"将文件内容作为资源暴露\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">open</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'r'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> encoding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">'utf-8'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> f<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> f<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> __name__ <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"__main__\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>transport<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"stdio\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># client.py - MCP Client 连接并使用 Server</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ClientSession<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> StdioServerParameters\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stdio <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> stdio_client\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 配置 Server 启动参数</span>\nserver_params <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StdioServerParameters<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    command<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"python\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    args<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"server.py\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    env<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">use_mcp</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> stdio_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>server_params<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> write<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> ClientSession<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> write<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 初始化连接</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>initialize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 发现可用工具</span>\n            tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>list_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"可用工具: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 调用工具</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"read_file\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"path\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"test.txt\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"结果: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: MCP 和 Function Calling 有什么关系？</strong><br>\nA: MCP 不是 Function Calling 的替代品。Function Calling 是模型侧的调用格式（模型输出 tool_calls），MCP 是应用侧的工具接入协议（标准化发现、连接、调用工具）。实际系统中，MCP 提供工具来源，Function Calling 是模型选择和调用工具的方式，二者配合使用。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: MCP Server 怎么被 LLM 用到？</strong><br>\nA: Host 通过 MCP Client 获取 Server 的工具列表，将工具描述转换成模型支持的 Function Calling / Tool Use 格式，然后让模型决定调用哪个工具。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：MCP 是 Function Calling 的升级版/替代品。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：二者解决不同层面的问题。Function Calling 关注模型怎么调用工具，MCP 关注工具怎么标准化接入 AI 应用。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：MCP 只支持本地工具。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：MCP 支持 stdio（本地）和 HTTP/SSE（远程）多种传输方式。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：MCP 是 Anthropic 独占的技术。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：MCP 是开放协议，任何 AI 应用都可以实现 Host/Client/Server。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}